		"&a&lFirst Line of Code"
		"&8&m                                "
		""
		"&7Your introduction to Arcadia. This chapter explains the"
		"&7core mechanics every other branch relies on."
		""
		"&a&lBranch:&r &fIntroduction"
		"&a&lStage:&r &fStarting point"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Read this first. The whole progression tree unlocks from here."
	]
