	quest.0498A578D0EC3254.quest_desc: [
		"&6&lBasic Control Circuit"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7The Basic Control Circuit is infused from osmium and"
		"&7redstone. Almost every Mekanism machine needs at least one."
		""
		"&6&lCategory:&r &fControl Circuits"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Set up steady osmium and redstone, you will craft many of these."
