		"&c&lPlutonium Pellet"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Process radioactive waste in the Isotopic Centrifuge to"
		"&7press out Plutonium Pellets, a step toward antimatter."
		""
		"&c&lCategory:&r &fFission Reactor"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Plutonium turns a reactor problem into a valuable resource."
