		"&6&lThe Bottling Machine"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Gather the light and redstone engineering blocks, conveyors,"
		"&7fluid pumps, sheetmetal and scaffolding for the Bottling Machine."
		""
		"&6&lCategory:&r &fMultiblock Machines"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Carry items across it and it fills every container from a tank."
