			"&c&lSpeed and Stack Upgrades"
			"&8&m                            "
			""
			"&7Speed Upgrades make an Importer, Exporter or other device"
			"&7run faster. Stack Upgrades let it move whole stacks at a time."
			""
			"&c&lCategory:&r &fUpgrades"
			""
			"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Combine both for an importer that empties a chest in seconds."
