		"&7Obtain an Apotheosis gem. Slotted into socketed gear,"
		"&7a gem grants a powerful bonus all its own."
		""
		"&b&lCategory:&r &fGems"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Gems drop from mobs and chests. The rarer the gem, the better."
	]
