		"&6&lGather Wood"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Collect logs of any wood type. The very first resource"
		"&7a survival run needs, and the base of every plank."
		""
		"&6&lCategory:&r &fMaterials"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Punch a tree to begin. Replant saplings to keep wood flowing."
