		"&9&lYeti Armor"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Forge the full yeti armor set: helmet, chestplate,"
		"&7leggings and boots, woven from alpha yeti fur."
		""
		"&9&lCategory:&r &fArmor"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Yeti armor knocks back any enemy that dares to strike you."
