		"&a&lDecorated Pot Sherds I"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Brush suspicious blocks to recover six decorated pot"
		"&7sherds, each one carved with a scene from an ancient,"
		"&7long-forgotten story."
		""
		"&a&lCategory:&r &fPot Sherds"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Four sherds combine on a crafting grid into one decorated pot."
	]
