		"&c&lReactor Logic Adapter"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7The Fission Reactor Logic Adapter reports reactor status"
		"&7as a redstone signal, and can accept commands in return."
		""
		"&c&lCategory:&r &fFission Reactor"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7It is how you read damage and danger from a safe distance."
