		"&a&lPrismarine Crystals"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Right-click an Apotheosis spawner with prismarine"
		"&7crystals to widen its activation range, the distance a"
		"&7player can be before spawning stops."
		""
		"&a&lCategory:&r &fSpawn Reach"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Each use adds 4 blocks, up to a maximum range of 48."
