		"&6&lTurbine Valves and Vents"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Turbine Valves carry steam into the turbine and energy out,"
		"&7while Turbine Vents release the spent steam after use."
		""
		"&6&lCategory:&r &fIndustrial Turbine"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Balance valves and vents to keep steam flowing smoothly."
	]
