		"&a&lAlchemist Cauldron"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Craft the Alchemist Cauldron. It brews the inks you"
		"&7need to inscribe spells of every rarity."
		""
		"&a&lCategory:&r &fCrafting"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7No ink, no spells. Set up the cauldron before inscribing."
