			"&b&lNetwork Bridge"
			"&8&m                            "
			""
			"&7Pair a Network Transmitter with a Network Receiver to bridge"
			"&7two separate Refined Storage networks, even across dimensions."
			""
			"&b&lCategory:&r &fNetwork Core"
			""
			"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Both ends need power and a network card binding them together."
