		"&6&lSimply Swords Guide"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Craft the Simply Swords guide book. It explains every"
		"&7weapon type, ability and the runic upgrade system."
		""
		"&6&lCategory:&r &fMaterials"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Read it before forging. The guide saves a lot of trial and error."
