		"&3&lRitual Brazier"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Craft the Ritual Brazier. Drop a ritual tablet into it"
		"&7and feed it source to perform powerful rituals."
		""
		"&3&lCategory:&r &fApparatus"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Build one near a source supply so rituals never run dry."
