		"&b&lDiamond Fishing Rod"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7The Diamond Fishing Rod is tough and reliable, the rod"
		"&7that carries an angler through every water in the world."
		""
		"&b&lCategory:&r &fFishing Rods"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7It outlasts every earlier rod. A worthy long-term tool."
	]
	quest.4588B176649A1E0A.quest_subtitle: "&7A rugged rod for the long haul"
	quest.4588B176649A1E0A.title: "&b&lDiamond Fishing Rod"
	quest.459D703FE786B031.quest_desc: ["The Carminite Ghastling is asked of you. Quiet progress beats loud setbacks."]
