		"&6&lCrying Obsidian"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Gather crying obsidian. It glows with a purple light"
		"&7and forms the core of a respawn anchor."
		""
		"&6&lCategory:&r &fMaterials"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Piglins barter crying obsidian, so bring gold to trade."
