			"&9&lAdvanced Pump Upgrade"
			"&8&m                            "
			""
			"&7It pumps fluids between the Tank upgrade and the blocks nearby."
			"&7This advanced model adds more filter slots and greater reach."
			""
			"&9&lCategory:&r &fStorage Upgrades"
			""
			"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Upgrades slot into the upgrade tab, only while there is room."
