		"&9&lCryomancer Robes"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Forge the Cryomancer Robes, a complete mage robe set. Mage robes"
		"&7boost the power of their matching spell school."
		""
		"&9&lCategory:&r &fRobes"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Wear a full matching set to maximise that school spell power."
