		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7The Energy Tablet stores energy in a hand-held form and"
		"&7is a core part of energy cubes and many tools."
		""
		"&c&lCategory:&r &fPower"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Keep a charged one on your hotbar to top up gear in the field."
