		"&7Together they summon the Nether deadliest boss."
		""
		"&4&lCategory:&r &fBoss"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Skulls drop rarely. A looting sword greatly improves the odds."
	]
	quest.4A4C71C43519D5FE.quest_subtitle: "&7Gather what the ritual demands"
	quest.4A4C71C43519D5FE.title: "&4&lWither Materials"
	quest.4A52140F0782B437.quest_desc: [
		"&9&lGolden Armor"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Craft golden armor. Its defense is poor, but Piglins"
		"&7treat anyone wearing gold as a friend."
		""
		"&9&lCategory:&r &fArmor"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Keep a gold piece handy before any trip to the Nether."
	]
	quest.4A52140F0782B437.quest_subtitle: "&7Weak metal, clever use"
	quest.4A52140F0782B437.title: "&9&lGolden Armor"
	quest.4A540441D426937E.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lIron Weapons"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Forge the complete Iron weapon set: all fifteen"
		"&7weapon types, from rapier and katana to greathammer."
		""
		"&e&lCategory:&r &fWeapon Tier"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Simply Swords adds 15 weapon classes. Find the style that fits you."
