			"&d&lCider"
			"&8&m                            "
			""
			"&7Cider is a beverage of fermented apples, with crisp apple"
			"&7notes ranging from sweet to dry, a classic of England."
			""
			"&d&lCategory:&r &fSpecialty Drinks"
			""
			"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7The one drink of the chapter made from apples, not grapes."
		]
