		"&b&lSolar Neutron Activator"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7The Solar Neutron Activator uses open sunlight to irradiate"
		"&7a gas, turning lithium into tritium and waste into polonium."
		""
		"&b&lCategory:&r &fFusion Reactor"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Place it high under clear sky for the fastest activation."
	]
