		"&b&lFlux Plug"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Place a Flux Plug against a generator or energy block. It"
		"&7passively pulls their power and adds it to your Flux Network."
		""
		"&b&lCategory:&r &fThe Network"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Plugs are the inputs. One on every generator keeps the grid fed."
