		"&d&lOccultism"
		"&8&m                                "
		""
		"&7Dive into dark magic. Summon spirits, bind demons and"
		"&7automate through otherworldly servants."
		""
		"&d&lBranch:&r &fMagic"
		"&d&lStage:&r &fLate game"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7A darker branch of magic, rewarding once you embrace the occult."
	]
