			"&9&l65536B Fluid Storage Part"
			"&8&m                            "
			""
			"&7It holds liquids inside a Storage Housing, ready to plug into"
			"&7a Disk Drive on your network."
			"&7Its capacity reaches 65536B buckets."
			""
			"&9&lCategory:&r &fFluid Disks"
			""
			"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Slot it into a Storage Housing to make a full Storage Disk."
