		"&c&lFission Reactor Ports"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Reactor Ports are the doors of the reactor wall. Through"
		"&7them flow fuel in, coolant in and steam or waste out."
		""
		"&c&lCategory:&r &fFission Reactor"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Set each port to input or output with a Configurator."
