		"&8&m                                "
		""
		"&7Shows details about the chunk you stand in, who"
		"&7owns it, and whether it is claimed or force-loaded."
		""
		"&b&lUsage:&r  &f/ftbchunks info"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Use it before building to check a spot is free, or to find out who owns the land around you."
