		"&6&lMetal Dusts"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Gather iron, silver, gold and copper dust. Ground metal"
		"&7feeds the alchemy and ritual recipes of Occultism."
		""
		"&6&lCategory:&r &fMaterials"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7A pulverizer doubles your ingots into dust. Worth the setup."
	]
