		"&9&lIron Armor"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Craft a full set of iron armor, the dependable"
		"&7protection that suits almost any situation."
		""
		"&9&lCategory:&r &fArmor"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7A full iron set is the safe baseline before any boss fight."
