		"&a&lChemical Crystallizer"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7The Chemical Crystallizer dries clean mineral slurry into"
		"&7solid crystals, the final form before crushing and smelting."
		""
		"&a&lCategory:&r &fChemistry"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7It closes the five-times chain that began at dissolution."
