		"&5&lBinding Ritual"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Craft the Binding Ritual. Place its tablet in a Ritual Brazier"
		"&7and feed it source to unleash a powerful lasting effect."
		""
		"&5&lCategory:&r &fRituals"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Rituals are one-shot. Gather the source they need beforehand."
	]
	quest.634B477861AC9162.quest_subtitle: "&7The Binding Ritual, a rite of power"
	quest.634B477861AC9162.title: "&5&lBinding Ritual"
