		"&2&lThe Doubling Factory"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Add a Crusher to the doubling line. Crusher, Enrichment"
		"&7Chamber and Energized Smelter form a full closed loop."
		""
		"&2&lCategory:&r &fStructures"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7The crusher turns ingots back to dust so nothing is lost."
