		"&7adds enchanting power that higher-tier enchants demand."
		""
		"&b&lCategory:&r &fEnchanting Shelf"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Stronger shelves enable stronger enchantments. Mix shelf types freely."
	]
	quest.6852BEFDD4DE4E4B.quest_subtitle: "&7The Soul Touched Deepshelf, an enchanting shelf"
	quest.6852BEFDD4DE4E4B.title: "&b&lSoul Touched Deepshelf"
	quest.6861CF48F796442A.quest_desc: ["The Pinch Beetle: a useful checkpoint on this branch. Next door is in sight."]
	quest.6861CF48F796442A.quest_subtitle: "The Pinch Beetle unlocks more."
	quest.6861CF48F796442A.title: "Pinch Beetle"
	quest.68819A10549255E3.quest_desc: ["Pull the Swarm Spider into your kit. Aim for the next thing."]
	quest.68819A10549255E3.quest_subtitle: "Brick: the Swarm Spider."
	quest.68819A10549255E3.title: "Swarm Spider"
	quest.6884E25641A1020C.quest_desc: [
		"&a&lLibrary"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Build the Library. This large block holds far more"
		"&7enchanting power than a single bookshelf can."
		""
		"&a&lCategory:&r &fFoundation"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7A few libraries replace whole walls of plain bookshelves."
