		"&c&lThe Ur-Ghast"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Defeat the Ur-Ghast once atop the Dark Tower and claim"
		"&7its trophy. Its fall thaws the path into the frozen north."
		""
		"&c&lCategory:&r &fBoss"
		"&a&lUnlocks:&r &fThe Snowy Forest and the Yeti Lair"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7It hides in the carminite. Reflect its fireballs to hurt it."
