		"&3&lThe Otherside"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Explore the Otherside itself, a vast dark realm where"
		"&7sculk covers everything and silence is your only ally."
		""
		"&3&lCategory:&r &fExploration"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Light is scarce here. Bring plenty of torches and stay alert."
