		"&f&lRainbow Chalk"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Craft Rainbow Chalk by combining every color. It shifts"
		"&7through hues and serves as a wildcard in many circles."
		""
		"&f&lCategory:&r &fRitual Chalk"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7A flashy upgrade. It stands in for several colors at once."
