		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Craft the Fire Rune. Runes carry the raw essence of a"
		"&7single spell school for use in upgrade orbs."
		""
		"&d&lCategory:&r &fSpellcasting"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Combine runes at the arcane anvil to build upgrade orbs."
