		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Craft the Seashelf. Placed near an enchanting table, it"
		"&7adds enchanting power that higher-tier enchants demand."
		""
		"&b&lCategory:&r &fEnchanting Shelf"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Stronger shelves enable stronger enchantments. Mix shelf types freely."
