		"&6&lVillager Hat"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7The Villager Hat lowers your trading prices with"
		"&7villagers, as if you always carried hero reputation."
		""
		"&6&lCategory:&r &fHeadgear"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Wear it before stocking up at a trading hall."
