		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7A Bin holds a vast stack of a single item. Basic up to"
		"&7ultimate, each tier swallows far more than the last."
		""
		"&5&lCategory:&r &fStorage"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Insert and pull with hoppers to build a bulk item warehouse."
