		"&d&lNetherite Spell Book"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Craft the Netherite Spell Book. A spell book stores the spells you"
		"&7have learned and lets you cast them in battle."
		""
		"&d&lCategory:&r &fSpellcasting"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Higher metal tiers hold more spell slots. Upgrade when you can."
	]
	quest.7408CCF998D9CD37.quest_subtitle: "&7A spell book of the metal tiers"
	quest.7408CCF998D9CD37.title: "&d&lNetherite Spell Book"
