		"&c&lSolar Generator"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7The Solar Generator makes a steady trickle of energy"
		"&7whenever it sits under open daylight."
		""
		"&c&lCategory:&r &fPower"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7It is your cleanest early power. Build a row of them on a roof."
	]
