	quest.7457B61539D4AE61.title: "&b&lScarlet Biplane"
	quest.7471CDF5166D38F0.quest_desc: [
		"&5&lFlight Ritual"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Craft the Flight Ritual. Place its tablet in a Ritual Brazier"
		"&7and feed it source to unleash a powerful lasting effect."
		""
		"&5&lCategory:&r &fRituals"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Rituals are one-shot. Gather the source they need beforehand."
