		"&2&lThermal Evaporation Plant"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7The Thermal Evaporation tower heats pumped water into brine"
		"&7and then lithium. A separator can split brine further."
		""
		"&2&lCategory:&r &fStructures"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Build it tall and in a hot, dry biome for the fastest output."
