		"&6&lSugar"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Right-click an Apotheosis spawner with sugar to cut its"
		"&7minimum spawn delay. Less waiting between mob batches."
		""
		"&6&lCategory:&r &fSpawn Rate"
