		"&5&lSacrificial Bowl"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Craft sacrificial bowls. They hold the reagents a ritual"
		"&7consumes and sit at the points of your chalk circle."
		""
		"&5&lCategory:&r &fSummoning"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7You need several bowls per ritual. Make a good batch at once."
	]
	quest.7F09F8F98C13F11B.quest_subtitle: "&7The altar of every ritual"
	quest.7F09F8F98C13F11B.title: "&5&lSacrificial Bowl"
