		"&a&lJungle River Fish"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Warm jungle rivers hide fierce fish, the giant arapaima,"
		"&7the toothy piranha, and the broad tambaqui."
		""
		"&a&lCategory:&r &fThe Catch"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Cast carefully, a piranha is just as happy to bite you."
	]
